| `input_adb_lookup(crowdstrike.csv)`
| `input_adb_lookup(nessus.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="crowdstrike.csv", "crowdstrike", source_lookup="nessus.csv", "nessus")
```### Keep only the columns the merge uses ###```
| fields _time, source, source_lookup, mac, nt_host, ip
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach mac, nt_host, ip [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Convert case insensitive fields to lowercase ###```
| foreach mac, nt_host [eval <<FIELD>>=lower(<<FIELD>>)]
```### Build match keys (lowercased where the field is case insensitive) ###```
| eval adbk_mac = mac, adbk_nt_host = nt_host
```### Remove blocklisted values from the match keys ###```
| eval `adb_key_blocklist(adbk_mac)`, `adb_key_blocklist(adbk_nt_host)`
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = mvjoin(mvdedup(mvappend(adbk_mac, adbk_nt_host)), "::")
| search _key=*
```### Tag multivalue values with their time (so the most recent ones can be kept) ###```
| eval `adb_tag_time(mac)`, `adb_tag_time(nt_host)`, `adb_tag_time(ip)`
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, values(adbk_mac) as adbk_mac, values(adbk_nt_host) as adbk_nt_host, values(mac) as mac, values(nt_host) as nt_host, values(ip) as ip by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = mvappend(adbk_mac, adbk_nt_host)
```### Merge: only the keys go through adbmerge, the result is joined back by row id ###```
| `adb_merge(25, 50)`
```### Clusters that were too large to merge go to assetdb_overflow for review, not into assetdb ###```
| `adb_save_overflow`
| where isnull(adb_overflow)
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, `adb_counters`, values(mac) as mac, values(nt_host) as nt_host, values(ip) as ip by _key
```### Newest values first: sort, de-duplicate and strip the time prefix ###```
| eval `adb_newest_first(mac)`, `adb_newest_first(nt_host)`, `adb_newest_first(ip)`
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval mac = mvindex(mac,0,4), nt_host = mvindex(nt_host,0,4), ip = mvindex(ip,0,4)
```### Run safety: how many assets did the last successful run produce? ###```
| `adb_run_guard(0.5)`
```### Record this run in assetdb_runs (the last 200 runs are kept) ###```
| `adb_record_run(0.5, 200)`
```### Only write the asset database when the run passed the safety check ###```
| `adb_write_gate`
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, mac, nt_host, ip
| outputlookup override_if_empty=false assetdb
